      "text": [
        "Suppliers and growers of semi-mature and mature trees and hedging in a vast selection of species, forms and sizes. We maintain a range of mature and semi-mature stock whilst sourcing those special requirements from some of Europe’s finest nurseries. All stock that we supply is of the highest quality"
