      "text": [
        "Troughs",
        "Custom grown 1m length hedge troughs of evergreen, deciduous and mixed native hedging. The troughs on averages contain 3 plants planted together to make a dense screen which can be implemented all year round.",
        "Hedges",
        "Our Instant Hedge Unit are available in larger sizes than the standard troughs and provide a more mature screen. The individual plants are clipped regularly to create blocks that when planted in a row form a dense, evenly clipped hedge. We also have semi-mature hedging units at 2m+ height.",
        "Pleached & Shaped Trees",
        "We have a vast selection of pleached, table top and box clipped evergreen and deciduous trees grown into specific forms and sizes. This extensive range allows us to cater for all budgets from freshly pleached to established mature screens."
      ]
    },
