      "text": [
        "Topiary",
        "Topiary is commonly formed into balls and box shapes, cones and pyramids, cloud-form and beehives. We have a large collection of beautiful evergreen and deciduous species formed into ornamental shapes and sizes.",
        "Standard Trees",
        "Growers and suppliers of a wide variety of native and non-native, semi-mature and mature, containerised trees that vary in size from 10-12cm up to 120cm+ in many forms and species.",
        "Multistem Trees",
        "Stunning selection of evergreen and deciduous multistem trees in a variety of sizes providing year round interest from an ornate tree structure."
      ]
